lean: n.choose 2 = n * (n - 1) / 2
tex: \binom{n}{2} = \frac{n \cdot \left(n - 1\right)}{2}

lean: deriv (fun x => x ^ 2) x = 2 * x
tex: \frac{d}{dx}\left(x^{2}\right) = 2 \cdot x

lean: Filter.Tendsto g Filter.atTop (nhds 0)
tex: \lim_{x \to \infty} g\left(x\right) = 0

lean: Continuous f
